sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent Page<br/>(React App)
    participant Iframe as Iframe<br/>(Lakehouse App)
    participant GoProxy as Go Proxy

    Note over Parent,Iframe: Future: postMessage Communication

    Parent->>Iframe: postMessage({<br/>  type: "EXECUTE_COMMAND",<br/>  payload: {...}<br/>}, targetOrigin)

    Note over Iframe: App receives message via<br/>window.addEventListener("message")

    Iframe->>Iframe: Validate message origin
    Iframe->>Iframe: Process command
    Iframe->>Parent: postMessage({<br/>  type: "COMMAND_RESULT",<br/>  payload: {...}<br/>}, parentOrigin)

    Note over Parent,Iframe: Example Use Cases

    Parent->>Iframe: Open specific notebook
    Iframe->>Parent: Notebook loaded

    Parent->>Iframe: Execute code cell
    Iframe->>Parent: Execution complete

    Parent->>Iframe: Save current state
    Iframe->>Parent: State saved

    Parent->>Iframe: Get current selection
    Iframe->>Parent: Selection data

    Note over Parent,GoProxy: Considerations

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
        Note over Parent,Iframe: Security:<br/>- Validate message origins<br/>- Whitelist allowed commands<br/>- Sanitize payload data
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Parent,Iframe: Future Enhancements:<br/>- Theme synchronization<br/>- Custom keybindings<br/>- Plugin integration<br/>- Real-time collaboration signals
    end
